                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There is a good game in here, but two things need to be corrected:\n\n1. Aiming is just off.  Even so when you are trying to pick up items.  There's so many times I've had to turn around in circles looking for the item I thought was about to get but instead it whooshs right past you.  It throws off the gameplay momentum.   Also, I know you can go into first person, but it doesn't seem to help.  \n\n2. Dear god, change the radar.  I think I know what they're trying to do, but it just becomes confusing and frustrating.  \n\nFor $5, I know can't really complain but I think fixing this  stuff could make this a pretty great space shooter instead of a \"meh\" .",
